{
  "locale": "zh",
  "namespace": "social.scene",
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_INTRO",
      "text": "我有件重要的事想告诉你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_KEY",
      "text": "我喜欢你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_REPLY",
      "text": "我也一直喜欢你。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_RESULT",
      "text": "那就一起走下去吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_INTRO",
      "text": "有些话，我还是想再说一次。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_KEY",
      "text": "我们能重新开始吗？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_REPLY",
      "text": "这次别再错过了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.REKINDLE_RESULT",
      "text": "重新认识彼此吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_FAIL_REPLY",
      "text": "对不起，我不能答应。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CONFESSION_FAIL_RESULT",
      "text": "……我明白了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BREAKUP_KEY",
      "text": "我们还是到这里吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BREAKUP_REPLY",
      "text": "……我知道了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RECONCILE_KEY",
      "text": "别再这样僵下去了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RECONCILE_REPLY",
      "text": "好，我们重新来过。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.GRIEF_KEY",
      "text": "我会记得你的。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.CHAT_KEY",
      "text": "嗨。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RIVAL_KEY",
      "text": "这笔账，我不会就这么算了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.RIVAL_REPLY",
      "text": "正好，我也没打算和你和解。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_1",
      "text": "我去别处坐。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_2",
      "text": "……我端到那边去。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_3",
      "text": "我想自己吃。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.WRATH_MEAL_SNUB_4",
      "text": "这顿我想清静点。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_UP_1",
      "text": "总感觉……还是差了一点火候。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_UP_2",
      "text": "有些话，现在还不是时候。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_UP_3",
      "text": "就到这里吧，也挺好的。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_COUPLE_1",
      "text": "我还有点没想好。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_COUPLE_2",
      "text": "有些话，我现在说不出口。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_COUPLE_3",
      "text": "也许……我们再等等。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_RIVAL_1",
      "text": "算了……犯不着。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_RIVAL_2",
      "text": "不说了，越说越气。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_RIVAL_3",
      "text": "我先走，省得又吵起来。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_SPLIT_1",
      "text": "先到这儿吧，我不想再吵了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_SPLIT_2",
      "text": "有些话还是别说绝了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_SPLIT_3",
      "text": "……让我想一想吧。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_FADE_1",
      "text": "好久没好好说话了。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BOUND_BLOCK_FADE_2",
      "text": "有空还是想找你聊聊。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_1",
      "text": "你还想接着吵？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_2",
      "text": "有话说清楚，别推我！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_3",
      "text": "你非得动手是吧？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_4",
      "text": "看着我，把话说完！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_5",
      "text": "还没完呢！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_6",
      "text": "别冲我指手画脚！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_7",
      "text": "你就一点错都没有？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_8",
      "text": "先别得意！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_9",
      "text": "你声音大就有理了？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_10",
      "text": "我可不会一直让着你！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_11",
      "text": "你倒是解释啊！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_12",
      "text": "这事我还没跟你算完！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_13",
      "text": "你还真敢动手！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_14",
      "text": "少说两句漂亮话！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_15",
      "text": "行，这回是我没站稳！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_16",
      "text": "旧账也不是你想翻就翻！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_17",
      "text": "说着话怎么就动手了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_18",
      "text": "退后，别再挤过来！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_19",
      "text": "别打完才来道歉！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_TRASH_TALK_20",
      "text": "你能不能把嘴放干净点！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_1",
      "text": "停一下，我站不稳了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_2",
      "text": "够了，我认输。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_3",
      "text": "不打了，让我缓缓！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_4",
      "text": "别打了，我错了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_SURRENDER_5",
      "text": "不打了，到这儿吧！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_1",
      "text": "真打起来了！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_2",
      "text": "你们倒是停一下啊！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_3",
      "text": "这也能打起来？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_4",
      "text": "谁去拉开他们？",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_5",
      "text": "小心！……我是说你们两个！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.BRAWL_CHEER_6",
      "text": "都退开一点！",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_1",
      "text": "对不起……对不起……",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_2",
      "text": "别看我。谁都别看我。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_3",
      "text": "我们得活下去。就这样而已。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_4",
      "text": "这不算杀人。这是活下去。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_5",
      "text": "闭上眼睛，很快就好。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_6",
      "text": "我会记得你的名字。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SCENE.FAMINE_BUTCHER_7",
      "text": "总得有人做这件事。",
      "contractRevision": 1,
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  ]
}
